# The 2026-07-13 "previous-epoch ML tools" block is gone (2026-08-09): all three
# files it covered are resolved. pimd_corpus_check.py was re-tracked 2026-07-15
# (v1.5+ reads the current v1.32+ target_id/distance_mm schema); pimd_v2_findings.py
# and pimd_classify.py were deleted at the cal_3x10_v1 epoch turnover, the latter
# archived to history first. No rule replaces them — everything in src/*.py is now
# repo source, and a rule guarding a deleted path only suggests it is still around.

